data: {"messages":[{"content":"请测试 `object-statistics` skill 的 Agent 真链路。\n\n必须严格执行：\n1. 先调用 read_file 读取 `/mnt/skills/custom/object-statistics/SKILL.md`。\n2. 再调用 bash 执行下面这段命令，不要改路径，不要省略任何输出文件。\n3. 执行完成后读取 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/object-statistics/result.json`，并在最终回复中返回这个 JSON 的内容和简短结论。\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/object-statistics\npython /mnt/skills/custom/object-statistics/scripts/run.py --camera-id CAM_DEERFLOW_001 --index citybrain-video-library --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/object-statistics/result.json\n```\n\n成功判定：必须能看到 read_file 读取该 SKILL.md、bash 执行该 skill 入口、并生成 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/object-statistics/result.json`。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"89591784-71c6-4a96-9a6d-abda3305cf99"},{"content":"我将严格按照要求测试 `object-statistics` skill 的完整链路。\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":104,"prompt_tokens":9463,"total_tokens":9567,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":30,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":104},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":9463}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-1ee01ce5-975f-92e1-b0f4-e7bd77631ef3","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e825b-a20b-7f51-9c61-d9086b84c561-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"description":"读取 object-statistics skill 文档","path":"/mnt/skills/custom/object-statistics/SKILL.md"},"id":"call_5a506820b63a4d6c82e615af","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":9463,"output_tokens":104,"total_tokens":9567,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":30}}},{"content":"---\nname: object-statistics\ndescription: Compute object statistics for monitoring videos from Elasticsearch video-library records or local detections/tracks JSON. Use when Codex needs counts by label, camera, time bucket, or movement state.\n---\n\n# Object Statistics\n\n## Execution Priority\n\nPrioritize calling this skill's `scripts/run.py` entrypoint first. Only write custom code after the script result is unsuitable or the script cannot cover the requested task.\n\n## Input Resolution\n\nIf the user provides detections or tracks JSON, pass them directly. If the user asks for statistics over indexed videos, query Elasticsearch with the provided `video_id`, `camera_id`, and time filters.\n\n## Atomic CLI\n\n```bash\npython object-statistics/scripts/run.py --index citybrain-video-library --camera-id CAM_DEERFLOW_001 --group-by label,camera,time,movement --config <config.json> --output <stats.json>\n```\n\nParameters: `--input`, `--index`, `--video-id`, `--camera-id`, `--start-time`, `--end-time`, `--detections-json`, `--tracks-json`, `--group-by`, `--config`, `--output`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Load local detections/tracks if provided.\n2. Otherwise retrieve matching video documents from Elasticsearch.\n3. Aggregate object counts by label, camera, time bucket, and movement state.\n4. Return normalized statistics suitable for reporting.\n\n## Outputs\n\nReturns `total_objects`, `by_label`, `by_camera`, `by_time_bucket`, and `movement_states`.\n\n## Failure Modes\n\n- `MISSING_INPUT`\n- `ES_CONNECTION_FAILED`\n- `ES_REQUEST_FAILED`\n\n## Constraints\n\nDo not infer business events or abnormal behavior. This skill only counts and groups detected/tracked objects.\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"381eb82e-2238-4148-98c8-71c1d1f855fc","tool_call_id":"call_5a506820b63a4d6c82e615af","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"现在执行 bash 命令运行该 skill 的入口脚本：\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":130,"prompt_tokens":9926,"total_tokens":10056,"co